%% WorkflowState live path (current handlers)
%% Figure 8.1
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> RECEIVED: WorkflowInitializationService
  RECEIVED --> WAITING_FOR_GUARDIAN: ActionCreatedEventHandler
  WAITING_FOR_GUARDIAN --> WAITING_FOR_VAULT_RESPONSE: GuardianApprovedEventHandler
  WAITING_FOR_GUARDIAN --> FAILED: GuardianRejectedEventHandler
  WAITING_FOR_VAULT_RESPONSE --> COMPLETED: ActionResponse APPROVED/COMPLETED/SUCCESS
  WAITING_FOR_VAULT_RESPONSE --> FAILED: ActionResponse REJECTED or other
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]

  note right of RECEIVED
    IN_PROGRESS exists in the enum
    but is not assigned by live handlers.
    WORKFLOW_COMPLETED / WORKFLOW_FAILED
    require IN_PROGRESS and are ignored.
  end note
